WEBVTT

00:00.880 --> 00:05.120
The Eunuch has long served by Father's side. As his son, wishing to show filial piety, I must trouble the Eunuch's guidance.

00:11.800 --> 00:16.200
A few days ago, His Majesty felt his eyesight dimming and had the imperial physician brew a vision-clearing draught.

00:16.480 --> 00:19.800
He drank it for several days; but today, he has stopped summoning the physician altogether.

00:22.920 --> 00:26.500
Last night... men from the Imperial City Guard already had an audience with His Majesty.

00:27.120 --> 00:29.000
My deepest thanks to Eunuch Wen for the warning.
